{"id":"sh/7ipsfmho","kind":"textbox","name":"Title 1","position":{"left":88,"top":38.33,"width":1104,"height":139.17},"text":"Task 2 - P3: Safe cloud releases","style":{"fontSize":58.67,"typeface":"Aptos Display","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}},
{"id":"sh/6hgr6hg3","kind":"textbox","name":"block-1-label","position":{"left":88,"top":190,"width":1104,"height":36},"text":"Weeks 4-6 | Ops lead + database owner","style":{"fontSize":26.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#C00000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/lg7adczi","kind":"textbox","name":"block-1-text","position":{"left":88,"top":230,"width":1104,"height":113},"text":"Create a reproducible staging environment and versioned infrastructure configuration; propose Terraform on existing Google Cloud. Add versioned migrations and compatibility checks for all three applications.","style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/kfy947yx","kind":"textbox","name":"block-2-label","position":{"left":88,"top":347,"width":1104,"height":36},"text":"Production release control","style":{"fontSize":26.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#C00000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/jepsbmhc","kind":"textbox","name":"block-2-text","position":{"left":88,"top":387,"width":1104,"height":113},"text":"Promote the tested artifact after a named Ops approver signs the checklist. Release one small change at a time; observe errors and latency. Revert the application if the agreed guardrail is breached.","style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/ydgr2h0r","kind":"textbox","name":"block-3-label","position":{"left":88,"top":504,"width":1104,"height":36},"text":"Acceptance and recovery","style":{"fontSize":26.67,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#C00000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/5cbapgzm","kind":"textbox","name":"block-3-text","position":{"left":88,"top":544,"width":1104,"height":113},"text":"Rehearse release, application rollback and database restore in staging. Publish a runbook with alert contacts. Keep incompatible schema removal out of the pilot; application rollback does not automatically undo data changes.","style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
